{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act24side_level_act24side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act24side",
  "stageId": "act24side_09",
  "title": "决战！燃烧的狩魂！",
  "storyCode": "CF-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b0cf3b384dbbbb03c5efe2615c2936166e0bd2eb3ceb902890f1bd4080d415f7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g2_easternvillageB"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他跪在地上，右手仍抓着插在地上的狩猎矛。\n身体受伤了，但是他没感觉到痛，也许是痛感从太多处传来，衰老的神经已经迟钝到无法处理了。\n似乎没有流血，在高温的作用下水汽瞬间蒸腾，皮肤被炙烤到失去痛觉，只留下一片黑色的血痂。\n喉咙深处火辣辣的，散发着浓烈的甜腥味，他忽然感受到一阵来自腹部的痉挛，是什么涌了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呕——哇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸——呸，*东国粗口*，真恶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨大的吼声让他的耳膜隆隆作响，意识从混沌的泥泞中剥离出来。\n他抬起头，凝望着眼前正在重新站起的庞然巨物。\n凝望着它的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是了，我想起来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数分钟前的画面涌上脑海，在喷吐火焰的间隙中他抓住了稍纵即逝的机会，将矛尖射入了火龙的头颅。\n代价是，他没能躲过下一次的冲撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血！哈哈，你感觉到痛了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我！我让你流血了！受伤的滋味怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就看见了......你头颅上那些鳞片不够坚硬，你的脆弱我一览无余！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你并不是坚不可摧的......你会受伤，所以你也会倒下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等......喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！你要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才刚让你受伤了！你不能逃跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还能战斗！我们没有决出胜负！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他拄着狩猎矛，试图将身体支撑起来，但最后膝盖只勉强维持住了一个角度。\n矛柄深深地嵌进地面，他身后的影子剧烈地颤抖着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不能离开这里！我不会......让你过去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次能让你流血，那这一次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会将矛尖刺入你的心脏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狩猎矛被高高举起，或许因为是在最后的时刻，佝偻的身躯爆发出超乎想象的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他奔跑了起来，再一次地，向着只可仰望的生命发起冲锋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......还没死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，再来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他的右手仍然死死地抓着狩猎矛，指甲嵌进了手掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他拼命地捶打着自己的大腿，但肌肉只是毫无回应地震颤。\n这一次，这副身体里的最后一丝气力也不复存在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狩猎矛从手中滑落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站起来！站起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可恶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏生义冈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_755_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站起来啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他睁大了眼睛。\n他看见了。\n年幼的孩子举起弓箭，正对着火龙的身躯。\n瘦弱的手臂颤抖着，目光却没有一丝一毫的移动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_756_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪、怪物......不许靠近爷爷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_756_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我！我是和也！我也是村里的猎人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_756_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不许你再破坏村子了！我们会拦住你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_756_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑角！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺救下来了！孩子应该没有大碍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "学者猫，你们去把孩子和柏生先生带到安全的地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工匠猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_751_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扛上车喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火龙......受伤了？是这名泰拉的猎人做的吗？竟然就用这把泰拉的矛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学者猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_752_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这名猎人......身体好轻，哪里来的这么大力气喵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_756_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥哥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_1030_noirc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很勇敢哦，已经是合格的猎人了，但今天还是先让大人来处理好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰煌煌。\n此刻，另一副遍体鳞伤的身体站在了火龙的面前。\n她弯下腰，伸出手臂，拾起了地上的狩猎矛。\n而后，用力地将它插入地面。\n身躯笔直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢您争取的时间，柏生先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在请好好在一边歇着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_1029_Yato2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜刀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......交给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑角",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺准备好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "随从艾露猫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_9998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "决战！开始了喵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
